				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θαλλία</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> as pr. n., 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θάλεια</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				111
			</span></i>.</div>
